.TH CW "1" "October 2026" "cw 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cw \- cw leave
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cw
\fI\,leave \/\fR[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR] [\fI\,TARGET\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IP
Remove a window from its Context.
.IP
Without TARGET, removes the current (focused) window. TARGET can be
Context/Window, a ref number, or an iTerm title.
.IP
Examples:
.TP
cw leave
current window
.TP
cw leave LitTerra/????????????
specific window by name
.TP
cw leave 14
by ref number
.TP
cw leave IoT
by iTerm title
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompt.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show this message and exit.
